'''Fire Sales''' are events hosted by {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} in the {{zone|Community Center}}, where players can purchase exclusive cosmetic items for {{Gems}}. Fire Sale stock is limited and never returns once a sale has ended.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/taylor-seasonal-bundle-information.5775687/</ref>

